    {
      "source": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"cluster.html\">Cluster support</a> is based on the same building blocks as non-clustered communication. <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisClusterConnection.html\">RedisClusterConnection</a></code>, an extension to <code>RedisConnection</code>, handles the communication with the Redis Cluster and translates errors into the Spring DAO exception hierarchy.\n<code>RedisClusterConnection</code> instances are created with the <code>RedisConnectionFactory</code>, which has to be set up with the associated <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisClusterConfiguration.html\">RedisClusterConfiguration</a></code>, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "<a class=\"xref page\" href=\"cluster.html\">集群支持</a> 基于与非集群通信相同的构建模块。<code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisClusterConnection.html\">RedisClusterConnection</a></code> 是 <code>RedisConnection</code> 的扩展，负责处理与 Redis 集群的通信并将错误转换为 Spring DAO 异常层次结构。<code>RedisClusterConnection</a> 实例通过 <code>RedisConnectionFactory</code> 创建，该工厂必须配置相关的 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisClusterConfiguration.html\">RedisClusterConfiguration</a></code>，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Configure <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/lettuce/LettuceConnectionFactory.html\">LettuceConnectionFactory</a></code> or <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/jedis/JedisConnectionFactory.html\">JedisConnectionFactory</a></code>, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "配置 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/lettuce/LettuceConnectionFactory.html\">LettuceConnectionFactory</a></code> 或 <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/jedis/JedisConnectionFactory.html\">JedisConnectionFactory</a></code>，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The Redis Master/Replica setup — without automatic failover (for automatic failover see: <a href=\"#redis:sentinel\">Sentinel</a>) — not only allows data to be safely stored at more nodes.\nIt also allows, by using <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"drivers.html#redis:connectors:lettuce\">Lettuce</a>, reading data from replicas while pushing writes to the master.\nYou can set the read/write strategy to be used by using <code>LettuceClientConfiguration</code>, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "Redis 主从架构（无自动故障转移；如需自动故障转移，请参阅：<a href=\"#redis:sentinel\">Sentinel</a>）不仅允许数据在更多节点上安全存储。它还可以通过使用 <a class=\"xref page\" href=\"drivers.html#redis:connectors:lettuce\">Lettuce</a>，实现从副本读取数据并将写入操作推送到主节点。您可以使用 <code>LettuceClientConfiguration</code> 设置要使用的读写策略，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "For dealing with high-availability Redis, Spring Data Redis has support for <a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/sentinel\">Redis Sentinel</a>, using <code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisSentinelConfiguration.html\">RedisSentinelConfiguration</a></code>, as shown in the following example:",
      "translation": "为处理高可用 Redis，Spring Data Redis 支持<a href=\"https://redis.io/topics/sentinel\">Redis Sentinel</a>，使用<code><a class=\"xref attachment apiref\" href=\"../api/java/org/springframework/data/redis/connection/RedisSentinelConfiguration.html\">RedisSentinelConfiguration</a></code>，如下例所示：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code> can also be defined through <code>RedisSentinelConfiguration.of(PropertySource)</code>, which lets you pick up the following properties:",
      "translation": "<code>RedisSentinelConfiguration</code> 也可以通过 <code>RedisSentinelConfiguration.of(PropertySource)</code> 进行定义，从而拾取以下属性：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Sometimes, direct interaction with one of the Sentinels is required. Using <code>RedisConnectionFactory.getSentinelConnection()</code> or <code>RedisConnection.getSentinelCommands()</code> gives you access to the first active Sentinel configured.",
      "translation": "有时，需要与哨兵之一进行直接交互。使用 `<code>RedisConnectionFactory.getSentinelConnection()</code>` 或 `<code>RedisConnection.getSentinelCommands()</code>` 可访问配置的第一个活动哨兵。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>RedisClusterConfiguration</code> can also be defined through <code>RedisClusterConfiguration.of(PropertySource)</code>, which lets you pick up the following properties:",
      "translation": "<code>RedisClusterConfiguration</code> 也可以通过 <code>RedisClusterConfiguration.of(PropertySource)</code> 进行定义，该方法可读取以下属性：",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.master</code>: name of the master node.",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.master</code>：主节点名称。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.nodes</code>: Comma delimited list of host:port pairs.",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.nodes</code>：逗号分隔的主机名和端口对列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.username</code>: The username to apply when authenticating with Redis Sentinel (requires Redis 6)",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.username</code>：用于与 Redis Sentinel 进行身份验证时使用的用户名（需要 Redis 6）。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.password</code>: The password to apply when authenticating with Redis Sentinel",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.password</code>：与 Redis Sentinel 进行身份验证时使用的密码。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.dataNode.username</code>: The username to apply when authenticating with Redis Data Node",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.dataNode.username</code>：用于对 Redis 数据节点进行身份验证时的用户名。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.dataNode.password</code>: The password to apply when authenticating with Redis Data Node",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.dataNode.password</code>：与 Redis 数据节点进行身份验证时使用的密码。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.dataNode.database</code>: The database index to apply when authenticating with Redis Data Node",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.sentinel.dataNode.database</code>：在使用 Redis 数据节点进行身份验证时应用的数据库索引。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.cluster.nodes</code>: Comma-delimited list of host:port pairs.",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.cluster.nodes</code>：主机和端口对的逗号分隔列表。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>spring.redis.cluster.max-redirects</code>: Number of allowed cluster redirections.",
      "translation": "<code>spring.redis.cluster.max-redirects</code>：允许的集群重定向次数。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Redis can be operated in various setups.\nEach mode of operation requires specific configuration that is explained in the following sections.",
      "translation": "Redis 可以在多种配置环境中运行。\n每种运行模式都需要特定的配置，将在以下章节中详细说明。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The easiest way to get started is by using Redis Standalone with a single Redis server,",
      "translation": "最简单的入门方式是使用带有单个 Redis 服务器的 Redis 独立版。",
      "count": 1
    },
